<p>Fires a beam that turns matter into dust, inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">70, 94, 113, 129, 143</acronym> temporal damage and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">70, 94, 113, 129, 143</acronym> physical (warp) damage.</p><p>Alternatively you may target yourself, creating a field of radius <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> around you that will inflict the damage over three turns.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>